# Projects (PARA)

Each project folder:

```
ProjectName/
├── ProjectName.md      — MOC / overview
├── Project Kanban.md   — kanban-plugin board
├── RE-ENTRY.md         — context for returning
├── Features/           — feature specs
└── Notes & Logs/       — YYYYMMDD session logs
```

- Epic (`ProjectName.md`) links **down** to features in a table
- Feature specs link **up** to epic: `[[Project Name]]` immediately after frontmatter
- **Bidirectional** epic ↔ feature links when adding or editing either side

## Kanban

Boards use frontmatter `kanban-plugin: board` plus the plugin settings block at the file bottom. Do not strip or relocate that block when editing tasks.

Plugins in use: `dataview`, `obsidian-git`, `obsidian-kanban`, `templater-obsidian`, `bases`.
